  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Return and Reintegration of Third-Country Nationals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall project objective is to provide support to migrants to return voluntarily to their countries of origin and to contribute to their sustainable reintegration. To achieve this, the proposed project aims at facilitating assisted voluntary return of 700 third country nationals (TCNs) staying in Bulgaria and to provide 300 of them with reintegration assistance after voluntary return in the respective country of origin.</narrative>
  </description>
